  why: `How you judge strategies shapes which ones you use. If needing help means weakness, you'll keep choosing the hardest, least effective path and judging others who don't. This chapter invites a moral update: strategy is a form of strength. It also gives an intellectual history worth knowing, of a field that saw this decades ago and was forgotten because it seemed to threaten our self-image.`,
